        "hunk_index": 3,
        "change_category": "refactor",
        "intent_summary": "Refactored error handling with centralized cleanup labels and removed deprecated rxe_mr_alloc function to improve code organization and maintainability",
        "what": "Added alloc_mr_page_info call with error handling, restructured error cleanup using goto labels (err1/err2), and removed the static rxe_mr_alloc function",
        "how": "Centralizes memory deallocation in error paths ensuring proper cleanup order (free_mr_page_info before ib_umem_release), eliminates dead code from removed function, and standardizes error handling pattern across the function"
      }
    },
    {
      "intent_record": {
        "hunk_index": 4,
        "change_category": "refactor",
        "intent_summary": "Refactored the fast memory region initialization to delegate page allocation to the more specific alloc_mr_page_info function.",
        "what": "Replaced the function call 'rxe_mr_alloc' with 'alloc_mr_page_info' within the 'rxe_mr_init_fast' function.",
        "how": "Redirects the memory region initialization logic to a dedicated function for allocating page information, maintaining the existing error handling flow and return value usage."
      }
    },
